# ==============================================================================
# CMU 11-785: Personal Student Secrets Configuration Template
# Target Path: /home/jovyan/.env
# ==============================================================================
# Copy this file to your persistent JupyterHub home directory:
#   cp student.env.template /home/jovyan/.env
#
# PRIVACY & SECURITY:
# - This file resides on your private 32 GiB persistent volume (PVC).
# - It is unique to your user account and is NEVER shared with classmates.
# - It is NEVER committed to Git or printed in cleartext to logs.
# - `submit_tpu.train()` reads this file automatically and forwards your personal
#   credentials directly into your dedicated Cloud TPU v5e training pod.
# ==============================================================================

